WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.254
Toad hopped around his new yellow cart.

2
00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:09.454
"Toad seems very excited," said Mole.

3
00:00:09.455 --> 00:00:15.168
"Did he say we are going on a trip?" asked Rat.

4
00:00:15.169 --> 00:00:17.969
Toad stopped in front of them.

5
00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:22.610
"Well, I can’t go all by myself!" said Toad.

6
00:00:22.611 --> 00:00:25.273
"Forget it!" said Rat.

7
00:00:25.274 --> 00:00:29.559
"But you must see the world!" cried Toad.

8
00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:33.298
"My world is the river," said Rat.

9
00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:37.579
"Well, a trip might be fun," said Mole.

10
00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:41.760
Rat frowned and crossed his arms.

11
00:00:41.761 --> 00:00:45.777
"We don’t have to decide now," said Toad.

12
00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:47.962
"Lunch is ready!"

13
00:00:47.963 --> 00:00:51.338
They all went into the house.

14
00:00:51.339 --> 00:00:54.433
They sat down at the dining table.

15
00:00:54.434 --> 00:00:59.345
Everything inside was nice and fancy.

16
00:00:59.346 --> 00:01:03.146
The food was excellent.

17
00:01:03.147 --> 00:01:08.176
"There is nothing like traveling by cart!" said Toad.

18
00:01:08.177 --> 00:01:12.927
Toad spread his map across the table.

19
00:01:12.928 --> 00:01:16.322
He pointed at places they could visit.

20
00:01:16.323 --> 00:01:21.026
"Every day you see something new!" Toad said.

21
00:01:21.027 --> 00:01:24.845
"It sounds so exciting!" said Mole.

22
00:01:24.846 --> 00:01:28.750
Rat looked up from his plate.

23
00:01:28.751 --> 00:01:32.120
"Do you really want to go?" he asked Mole.

24
00:01:32.121 --> 00:01:34.450
Mole nodded eagerly.

25
00:01:34.451 --> 00:01:38.988
"Well, okay," said Rat.

26
00:01:38.989 --> 00:01:43.426
"Hooray!" said Toad.

27
00:01:43.427 --> 00:01:47.140
They went out to the stable again.

28
00:01:47.141 --> 00:01:51.400
Toad tied his gray horse up to the cart.

29
00:01:51.401 --> 00:01:54.631
Mole and Rat climbed in.

30
00:01:54.632 --> 00:01:57.393
Toad took the reins.

31
00:01:57.394 --> 00:02:03.641
"Off we go!" cried Toad.

